---
// "About us" block (Maria and Joanna). Used on the home page and on Visit us.
import '../styles/about-us.css';
---
<section class="au" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="au__photo"><img src="/images/about-owners.jpg" alt="Maria and Joanna in the store" loading="lazy" /></div>
  <div class="au__text">
    <h2 id="about-title">Hello! We're glad you're here!</h2>
    <h3>We are Maria and Joanna, Polish natives, friends,<br class="au__br" /> and we're pretty good cooks.</h3>
    <p>Our love of Poland, cooking and Polish food is what brought us here. We wanted one place where you could find everything that reminded us of home: Polish goods, groceries, and the most beloved homemade Polish dishes, made fresh to order.</p>
  </div>
</section>
